-48cf-8072-6cbb0382c571" facs="#m-3993fc9f-631d-4a91-b214-6f54f44f828c" label="text-like">St. Lawrence Justinian, Bishop and Conf. Smple.</l><l xml:id="m-3a32646a-b712-4942-98ab-e3294fa36177" facs="#m-6c7eb022-dea9-4883-a71c-215169fe8ba9" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-0edf3b80-bf19-4c3c-84c8-dae54e7dc4b4" facs="#m-7ed81902-b82b-4ade-a974-4eadeddbc729" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Státuit. p. 1182.</l><l xml:id="m-2f5abfc6-ad34-4db8-ad8a-40a3fa269bb4" facs="#m-9d434cdf-aaff-4960-86c5-8c6d25173e46" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0fe69a8a-10fa-4d86-bc9d-8ee895dfca05" facs="#m-fc010ff6-5413-46c4-ba34-bcb3196dfaa2" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus, omnípotens neránda solémnitas, * et devotió¬</l><l xml:id="m-63308ce4-036d-427a-a32a-42d39eb15219" facs="#m-d76135ee-e137-4275-9524-a16b50591a9b" label="lyrics-like">U Deus: f ut beáti Lauréntiil nem nobis áugeat, et salútem. Per</l><l xml:id="m-5d53d2a7-9446-4387-84b6-58ee6ae2f9e4" facs="#m-15aed7ad-92e2-4d46-8e1f-c846023d078d" label="lyrics-like">Confessóris tui atque Pontificis ve-Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-27221137-9f93-4203-808d-6db60f5d139e" facs="#m-54d38ec2-7f96-46d5-b9ef-b95ecb4383e7" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-72f1923a-027f-4298-afe8-7c57779286a7" facs="#m-20884375-df85-4d9c-bf33-04d75acf8c23" label="lyrics-like">NAncti tui, quaésumus, Dómine, eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia</l><l xml:id="m-491834d4-25f4-4ca7-bfff-f4214455e3cd" facs="#m-7f3581a5-3b57-4e5a-ab91-a73d88eda2c6" label="lyrics-like">O nos ubique laetificent: ut, duml sentiámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2236bbd3-a92f-42a7-8a9c-eaa138daf85f" facs="#m-6414da6f-ff17-4a98-a38f-0f6f0b75a62f" label="ambiguous">Postcommunien.</l><l xml:id="m-05b8bca9-13f7-4f64-8f6f-979760efa950" facs="#m-54b4ef4b-a49b-4922-9ca7-93f8b9e0eef8" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus, omnípotens beáto Lauréntio Confessóre tuo</l><l xml:id="m-bbcabf60-1b4b-4a85-9c31-41a5ece6ee49" facs="#m-b22d5fe1-caf5-4c19-9b50-5319ccff9b4a" label="lyrics-like">Deus, ut, de percéptis munéri-]atque Pontifice, beneficia potióra</l><l xml:id="m-79d88316-aa01-4753-adf6-4d648e59110f" facs="#m-34f2b0f1-60e0-4c5a-9f75-2878ec0f6a3c" label="lyrics-like">bus grátias exhibéntes, intercedénte sumámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-478eb099-05e7-4ed7-a671-3c5cffff15e9" facs="#m-3cbb3db0-82ed-4449-8273-ff5e5eff327f" label="text-like">S. THE NATIVITY OF THE BLESSED VIRGIN MARY.</l><l xml:id="m-e74790e1-6ca0-4ba4-8952-292cb9d04d60" facs="#m-7d48245c-1f2c-4400-9a26-0309c94f3ed9" label="text-like">Double of the second Class.</l><l xml:id="m-8a835564-6d97-4a09-8e9a-7be749411762" facs="#m-8b030577-0894-4e93-86e3-5b15efcb6a75" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-fe8ca850-11b4-4698-916c-60cbc01f3f04" facs="#m-e3219f3b-f972-4cdd-bcee-9957e2ad35e6" label="text-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 1625, except the following.</l><l xml:id="m-eaa2c608-dd10-4558-b8cb-c0de57822061" facs="#m-26e97888-d7c5-44fd-86c2-458c538e93b4" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-1ff4ecd9-6155-4dde-a9fa-b644769d2cba" facs="#m-06e792ce-dfa5-4019-8429-4584f09e9cd5" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.D2</l><l xml:id="m-6fa041a9-10aa-4f3e-bde9-7e885ee37c1f" facs="#m-e86b795c-a5ee-486a-9f1f-bd2abd3fc69a" label="ambiguous">G</l><l xml:id="m-d335b517-ec7f-4507-9417-7dd00f26a6c0" facs="#m-694418b8-1b82-418a-a9cb-7b04feb7ea73" label="lyrics-like">Lo-ri-ó- sae “ Vírgi-nis Ma-rí-ae órtum di¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
